WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:09.259
Texas Hold'em, no limit, for two to eight players. Everyone starts with the same pile of chips, and the computer can fill the table.

2
00:00:09.959 --> 00:00:17.555
You get two private cards. Five more are dealt face up in the middle, in three stages, the flop, the turn, and the river.

3
00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:20.334
With each stage there's a round of betting.

4
00:00:21.034 --> 00:00:30.404
On your turn you can fold, check or call, or raise. Use the slider for how much, or the quick buttons for half the pot, the whole pot, or all in.

5
00:00:30.554 --> 00:00:34.127
You've got forty seconds to act, or you fold automatically.

6
00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:41.436
At the end, the best five-card hand wins the pot. Straight flush at the top, high card at the bottom.

7
00:00:41.586 --> 00:00:46.193
Keep playing until one person has all the chips, or the hand limit is reached.
